# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS -- never commit credentials.
#
# The CurseForge token is read from the CURSEFORGE_TOKEN environment variable
# (see scripts/publish-release.ps1). It is deliberately NOT stored in any file
# in this repo. These patterns exist so that a local convenience file can never
# be committed by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.token
*.secret
secrets.*
*credentials*
curseforge-token*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# vendor/ -- THIRD-PARTY AND GAME-DERIVED CODE. DO NOT COMMIT.
#
# 2.7 GB total, and two parts of it must never be published:
#
#   vendor/SN2SDK      A Dumper-7 decompiled SDK of Subnautica 2 -- the game's
#                      entire class/field layout, derived from the shipped
#                      binaries. Redistributing it is a copyright/ToS problem
#                      regardless of how useful it is locally.
#   vendor/RE-UE4SS-src A full clone of UE4SS plus its build tree. It is a
#                      dependency to be cloned, not vendored into this repo.
#
# See README for how to recreate vendor/ from scratch.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
vendor/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output and logs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
build_vs/
out/
dist/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exp
*.lib
*.obj
*.ilk
*.log
UE4SS.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Game/user data that can leak save contents or local paths
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sav
_copilot_backup_*/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
